BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Superbutch x Understory
DTSTART:20260926T200000
DTEND:20260926T200000
UID:03e5e51814dcff4776d6fc6562ef26c1@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:with special guest AMRITA The Superbutch x Understory 2026 Per
 formance Residency starts off with a beautiful bang. Join us for an evenin
 g of music and community. Superbutch is the sparkled alterego of Toronto-b
 ased musician and producer Dinah. Past Superbutch projects include a fashi
 on show with live music at The Great Hall\, and a live band performing ins
 ide a giant audience-controlled juke box. Dinah is a working artist and co
 mmunity organizer. She is a reluctant performer but will show up if she ca
 n wear sequins. Current artistic goals include making weird shit and being
  useful in community spaces and social justice movements. dinahthorpe.com 
 Rooted in North Indian classical music and modal jazz\, AMRITA&#x27\;s sou
 nd blends intricate rhythms\, thematic melodies\, and spontaneous improvis
 ation. AMRITA’s music is shaped by a shared love of odd time signatures\
 , expressive tone\, and the interplay of texture and emotion. amritamusic.
 ca Understory is a trans-owned and operated cafe in the heart of Toronto
 ’s historic and always vibrant Church-Wellesley Village. Accessibility I
 nfo There will be amplified (but not super loud) music at this event. The 
 event will run from 8-10pm with lots of breaks. Seated and standing spaces
  will be available. Masks will be available at the door. Street level entr
 y\, wide front door\, automatic door opener\, fully accessible washroom. I
 f you need a free ticket or have any accessibilty questions\, please email
  dinah@dinahthorpe.com. SAVE THE DATES! October 24 - with Catriona Sturton
  November 21 - with Sean Carson Kinsella December 19 - with Maryem Tollar 
 ‍
LOCATION:Understory Cafe\, 505 Church St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/superbutch-x-understory
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
