UID:d74adfdbb3adf5c34fec315a4847caac@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:This September\, puff up your poodle skirts\, don your leather
  jackets and above all slather on buckets of hair gel as Dumpster Raccoon 
 Cinema is going BACK TO SCHOOL with a full-blown GREASE SINGALONG and SHAD
 OWCAST screening – featuring the fabulous talents of drag performers the
  NOTORIOUS GENDER MAKERS! Brought to you and hosted by Alex Brandy and ANN
 E ALIEN\, and made possible by @c1foundation\, we couldn&#x27\;t have imag
 ined a better place with @revuecinema or a better space alongside the Cult
  Classic King of Toronto @meakoopa &#x27\;s DUMPSTER RACOON! Join us for a
  Shadowcast like NO OTHER. Drag Performers will perform spotlight drag per
 formances to all songs for the film\, BUT not first before we spin a wheel
  to RANDOMLY decide who will be playing what roll! Will we be able to make
  it to Prom?! Grab tickets and see! And to celebrate\, Dumpster Raccoon is
  pulling out every stop – with a fully captioned singalong screening tha
 t is teaming up with the talents of the NOTORIOUS GENDER MAKERS company of
  performers for a fully shadowcast evening of song and screwball drag extr
 avagance! With video singalong preshow\, cocktails by the Shameful Tiki Ro
 om and media from our sponsors Bay Street Video! So practice your hand jiv
 e\, gas up your t-bird\, and get stitched into your greaser makeover final
  reveal because THIS FLYING CAR IS LEAVING THE GRADUATION CARNIVAL and YOU
 ’RE THE ONE THAT WE WANT! Cast announcement SOON🤫🤫 ‍
LOCATION:The Revue Cinema\, 400 Roncesvalles Ave
