BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Workshop: How to Organize Inclusive Events - with Alex Ketchum
DTSTART:20260927T150000
DTEND:20260927T150000
UID:dd97d6a7504a88f760ab25ec962c83e8@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a free workshop that also celebrates the launch of
  Alex D. Ketchum&#x27\;s new book How to Organize Inclusive Events &amp\; 
 Conferences. Have you ever wanted to organize a public event? Do you dream
  of hosting a battle of the bands\, film screenings\, concerts\, poetry re
 adings\, art shows\, teach-ins\, lectures\, seed exchanges\, zine workshop
 s\, and panels? What about a conference? Maybe you already have experience
  doing this work but you have noticed that inequities from the society-at-
 large are replicated at your events\, despite best intentions. Join us for
  a free workshop/ book event which will begin by celebrating the launch of
  Alex D. Ketchum&#x27\;s new book How to Organize Inclusive Events and Con
 ferences. This 90-minute event will include a workshop that will provide e
 vent and conference organizers of all levels with the tools to make their 
 events accessible\, sustainable\, and rooted in social justice principles.
  Whether you are new to organizing or highly experienced\, this book will 
 provide frameworks and practical tips to create inclusive events. No matte
 r the kind of event or conference you are interested in organizing\, wheth
 er large or small\, online\, in-person\, hybrid\, synchronous\, or asynchr
 onous\, this book includes what you need to know. From the smallest detail
 s (such as what to have in your bag on the day of the gathering) to large 
 topics (such as choosing a location\, selecting presenters\, funding\, des
 igning publicity materials\, working with community partners\, etc.) Acces
 sibility The entrance\, washrooms and space are wheelchair accessible. Ple
 ase do not wear perfume or cologne or strong scents to this event. ‍
LOCATION:Glad Day (32 Lisgar)\, 32 Lisgar
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/workshop-how-to-organize-inclusive-events-
 --with-alex-ketchum
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
