 ic\, games\, and a few other surprises. Music Policy: Afro House\, Amapian
 o\, Afrobeats\, Afro Electronic &amp\; More. DJ&#x27\;s: Martinses + Razaq
  El Toro + Revy B + Sonic Griot + Summer Knocks\, Hosts: Kaypasaa + Prempz
  Saxophone Vibes: B4Saxx Follow Us: Instagram: @sooafrikanah Don&#x27\;t m
 iss this chance to celebrate African culture at Afrikanah&#x27\;s Afrobeat
 s Experience - Afrique Like Me Edition! 📸 Photo Disclaimer:By attending
