 sed Off\, Still Laughing”\, the series makes no-holds-barred comedy out 
 of the self-loathing\, painfully relatable coping methods\, ignorable jobs
 \, and questionable hook ups that its duo of loveable\, chaotic queer outs
 iders live through. Bobbi Summers (creator &amp\; star) &amp\; Lily Kazimi
 era (contributing writer &amp\; star) will be present for a post screening
  Q&amp\;A\, where they’ll tell us the lengths they’d go for some chick
 en tendies. Please note that masking at this event is recommended. We ask 
 that attendees keep their masks on when they are not eating or drinking. C
 ontent Warning: I Hate People\, People Hate Me features scenes that involv
 e substance abuse\, suicidal ideation\, bullying\, and racism. ‍
