UID:22b07e5051b5114dbc9de79b541cdceb@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:WINE DUNG! &amp\; The Sapphic Wellness Summit presents... FINE
 &amp\;FLIRTY - A Sapphic Function - The OFFICIAL Sapphic Wellness Summit 2
 026 Pre-Party! Come join us for an evening full of sexy curated sounds\, s
 teamy performances\, a feature cocktail\, raffles\, giveaways + more! Tek 
 ah slow wine on a cutie\, feel up yuhself\, and dance wit yuh sapphic babe
 s! SOUNDS BY: Trinidaddy (@trinixdaddy) Tangerine (@tangerineplzz) Ms. Myl
 es (@madame.myles) Ace Dillinger (@ace_dillinger) SPECIAL PERFORMANCES BY:
  Gushy (@gushy.irl) Kingchella (@kingchella) Saturday\, October 3rd\, 2026
  4 pm - 9 pm Three Dollar Bill\, 1592 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON $20 online
 \, $25 at the door (cash or card) If you have a ticket to the Summit\, you
  will have a discount code to the party in your inbox! Check before you pu
 rchase! For anyone else\, once you buy a ticket to the pre-party\, you wil
 l receive a discount code to attend the Summit! Link to The Sapphic Wellne
 ss Summit tickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/the-sapphic-wellness-summi
 t-2026-tickets-1998599669412 4-5 PM - Mix &amp\; Mingle 5-9 PM - Dance Par
 ty\, Performances\, Giveaways &amp\; Raffle! The Sapphic Wellness Summit i
 s an event centered on inclusive\, holistic and community-driven sexual he
 alth education\, made by sapphics and for sapphics. The Sexual Health Seri
 es is an immersive day of education\, movement\, and community all about s
 ensuality\, pleasure and sex. This will be an unapologetically sex-positiv
 e space to explore and learn\, whether you’re new to sapphic sex\, want 
 to grow with your lovers\, or excited to explore self-pleasure + eroticism
 . It&#x27\;s happening on Sunday\, October 4th at Society Clubhouse. WINE 
 DUNG! is an event &amp\; fete series for queer &amp\; trans Caribbean peop
 le &amp\; QTBIPOC to free up themselves &amp\; build community\, all while
  prioritizing &amp\; highlighting Caribbean sounds. (FOR MORE INFO SEE TIC
